  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Capital Markets Supervision Capacities of The Albanian Financial Supervisory Authority Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the project is to (i) strengthen AFSA&#x2019;s capacity to regulate and supervise capital markets and to (ii)boost market development for capital market products through increased financial awareness and education, and stimulation of financial innovation.</narrative>
  </description>
